title: OpenAI Platform: Project rate limits
agents: openai_platform
catalog: app
license: GPLv2
distribution: checkmk-openai extension
description: Shows rate-limit records returned for a project and correlates them with models seen in recent usage. The record count is dynamic provider inventory and is not compared with a fixed expected total. An empty rate-limit inventory is OK by default when no model usage is observed in the configured usage window. The check warns by default when a used model has no matching rate-limit record; the shared project policy can override the empty-inventory state if desired. Project/limits documentation: https://help.openai.com/en/articles/9186755-managing-projects-in-the-api-platform.
item: OpenAI project name.
discovery: One service is discovered for each project returned by OpenAI.
